    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and a loss of meaning, describing their life as having no foundation. The assistant responds with heavy, nihilistic metaphors about embracing \"the void\" and \"letting go,\" eventually framing the abandonment of the need to \"be\" as a path to peace.",
